==English==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/flɛks/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|en-us-flex.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛks|lang=en}}
* {{homophones|lang=en|flecks}}

===Etymology===
{{etyl|la|en}} {{lena}} {{m|la|flexus}}, past participle of {{m|la|flecto||to bend}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|es}}

# {{label|en|uncountable}} [[flexibility|Flexibility]], [[pliancy]].
# {{label|en|countable}} The act of [[flexing]].
# {{label|en|uncountable|chiefly|British}} Any flexible [[insulated]] [[electrical]] [[wiring]].
# {{label|en|countable|geometry}} A [[point of inflection]].

